00:23:06.283 --> 00:23:08.251
My mom always like to repeat
this story of me as a kid


00:23:08.252 --> 00:23:10.417
Being asked what I wanted
to be when I grow up.


00:23:11.455 --> 00:23:16.626
I always used to say: invisible.
I don’t know quite what prompted it,


00:23:16.627 --> 00:23:18.675
but the thought of it stuck with me.


00:23:19.672 --> 00:23:21.887
It was only later that I found out


00:23:21.888 --> 00:23:25.056
that invisibility is in fact
the technical possibility.


00:23:25.928 --> 00:23:28.209
It was in this book that my
sister stole from the library


00:23:29.056 --> 00:23:30.228
and I stole from my sister.


00:23:31.308 --> 00:23:33.393
I followed her into crime,


00:23:33.394 --> 00:23:35.437
though she was better than me.


00:23:35.438 --> 00:23:37.528
She always sort of glowed innocence,


00:23:37.529 --> 00:23:40.572
Whereas I, to this day,
just sort of radiate guilt.


00:23:42.611 --> 00:23:44.782
Anyway, to be invisible is easy.


00:23:44.783 --> 00:23:46.908
You just have to find a
way to difract light.


00:23:46.909 --> 00:23:47.954
Screech


00:23:48.826 --> 00:23:51.045
Woaw. Are you trying to
get yourself killed?


00:23:52.079 --> 00:23:55.049
I haven’t managed it yet,
but I’m working on it.


00:23:56.167 --> 00:23:58.340
I didn’t just follow him,
I followed all of them.


00:23:59.295 --> 00:24:01.337
And it wasn’t stalking.


00:24:01.338 --> 00:24:04.636
You stalk a deer in order to kill
it, mount it, stick it on your wall


00:24:04.637 --> 00:24:07.762
And tell the story of how fucking
brilliant you are with a shotgun


00:24:07.763 --> 00:24:09.762
I didn’t wanna kill any of them.


00:24:09.763 --> 00:24:11.924
I certainly didn’t have any
interest in mounting them.


00:24:12.850 --> 00:24:16.070
And I don’t own a shotgun...
though I’d like one.


00:24:17.021 --> 00:24:19.194
I just wanted to check him, invisibly,


00:24:20.065 --> 00:24:21.705
To check if they’re sticking to the pact.


00:24:22.151 --> 00:24:24.370
That’s not stalking, it's
barely not even an espionage.


00:24:26.447 --> 00:24:29.417
Ok...
Now I know why you're ringing.


00:24:36.749 --> 00:24:38.797
